{"hw":"τιμόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">τιμόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">τιμόω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = τιμάω, in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Schwyzer</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">417.5</span> </span> (Elis); but the Rhodian forms <span class=\"gk\">τιμοῦντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12(1).155</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\"> i 10</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B.C.)</span>, <span class=\"gk\">τιμοῦσα</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1033.12</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iii B.C.)</span> may be the contractions of <span class=\"gk\">τιμάοντες</span>, etc., cf. <span class=\"gk\">Ἀγλούκριτος</span> (from <span class=\"gk\">Ἀγλαό-</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">GDI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4245.77</span> </span>, if not forms of <span class=\"gk\">τιμέω</span> (q.v.).</div></div>"}